nable steps to protect your account. Do not access other users' records, attempt to bypass security or subscription restrictions, or interfere with the service."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Before publication:"}]," The minimum account age and any age verification or parental consent arrangements must be finalized."]}]]]}],["$","section","health",{"id":"health","className":"reserved-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Health and Fitness Disclaimer"}],[["$","p",null,{"children":["Cubyfit provides general fitness, nutrition, habit and wellness tracking tools. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Cubyfit is not a medical service and does not provide medical diagnosis, treatment or individualized medical advice."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Calorie estimates, fitness targets, nutritional information and similar calculations are approximate. Individual needs vary. Exercise and nutrition decisions should take your circumstances into account. Seek advice from a qualified healthcare professional when appropriate. Cubyfit does not guarantee specific health, weight-loss, muscle-gain or personal-development results."}]]]}],["$","section","records",{"id":"records","className":"reserved-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"5. Personal Records and Content"}],[["$","p",null,{"children":"You retain your rights in original information you provide. Cubyfit processes your records to deliver the features you request, including optional cloud backup where enabled."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You are responsible for the accuracy of information you enter. Third-party food and exercise information may contain errors or be subject to separate licenses."}]]]}],["$","section","pro",{"id":"pro","className":"reserved-section","children":["$L23","$L24"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"],"$L2f"]}]
